<title>UK: Field Group first half pre-tax profits rise.</title>
<headline>Field Group first half pre-tax profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Sept 29</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		13.3		   vs 11.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.1		    vs 2.8</p>
<p> Pretax		     10.5		   vs 9.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   108.5		  vs 97.3</p>
<p>NOTE -- Field Group Plc produces consumer packaging.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 11.0		   vs 9.4</p>
<p> Interest		   0.5		    vs 0.3</p>
<p> Tax			  2.6		    vs 2.3</p>
<p> Net taxed		  7.9		    vs 6.8</p>
<p> Retained profit	  6.0		    vs 5.1</p>
<p> Pay date		   February 24 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  January 3 1997</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
